    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just burnout though. it feels more permanent than that. like i saw something out there that changed me, and everything they have here is just... empty. i look at people laughing at some trivial thing and i just feel more and more like a ghost. like i'm already gone, i'm just waiting for my body to realize it.",
